               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "An alien race dedicated to counteracting the effects of entropy. In other words, Incubators try to prevent the heat death of the universe. Incubators collect raw energy from a source that seems to be excepted from entropy: the emotions of girls between the ages of 14-18. Incubators form contracts with teenage girls, trading one wish for their servitude as a magical girl, they use their powers to defeat witches, who then drop grief seeds, allowing them to keep their powers in check. The energy produced during this process is then harvested through unknown means. It's not revealed to those who become magical girls that magical girls turn into witches upon falling into despair, which are then fought by other magical girls, creating an endless cycle. The justification for this is, that this process is saving countless other sectors of the universe, despite the expense of the human race.",
